---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
const lastUpdated = "October 19, 2026";
---

<MainLayout title="Privacy Policy">
  <main id="main-content" role="main">
    <section class="projects-section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="content-page">
          <div class="section-header">
            <h2 class="section-title">Privacy Policy</h2>
          </div>

          <div class="reveal" style="line-height: 1.8;">
            <p class="content-meta">
              Last updated: <time>{lastUpdated}</time>
            </p>

            <div class="content-section">
              <h3>Overview</h3>
              <p>This website respects your privacy. This policy explains what data is collected and how it's used.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="content-section">
              <h3>Data Collection</h3>
              <p>This site has no analytics, no accounts and no tracking. The only things stored are in your own browser:</p>
              <ul class="content-list-bulleted">
                <li>Theme preference - saved in local storage and a <code>theme</code> cookie</li>
                <li>Snake high score - saved in local storage</li>
              </ul>
              <p>Settle Up keeps everything in the page; nothing is saved or sent anywhere.</p>
              <p>IP Trace shows you what this site's server receives with every request (your IP address, approximate location, network and connection details, as provided by Cloudflare). It is sent back only to you and not stored or logged. The device details it shows (screen, graphics card, time zone) are read in your browser and never sent anywhere.</p>
              <p>Fingerprint reads your browser's characteristics to show how sites can recognise you; it runs entirely in your browser and sends nothing. Above You and Planet Now use the same approximate location as IP Trace. If you choose "use precise location", your device's coordinates stay in your browser.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="content-section">
              <h3>Third-Party Services</h3>
              <p>The whole site is hosted by Cloudflare, which sees your IP address like any website host. Your browser contacts no other outside service.</p>
              <p>Stock and financial data is fetched by this site's server (from Twelve Data and SEC filings), and so are satellite orbits (CelesTrak) and earthquakes (USGS), so your browser never contacts those providers.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="content-section">
              <h3>Your Rights</h3>
              <p>Since nothing about you is stored on the server, there is nothing to request or delete. Clearing this site's data in your browser removes the theme and high score.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="content-section">
              <h3>Contact</h3>
              <p>If you have questions about this privacy policy, email <a href="mailto:contact@supm3n.com">contact@supm3n.com</a>.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</MainLayout>